{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_schema", "label": "Modelagem de Dados Convex (schema \u2014 fonte de verdade)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_movimentacoes", "label": "Tabela movimentacoes (ledger)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_produtos", "label": "Tabela produtos", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "camaraId definido na cria\u00e7\u00e3o e nunca editado; edi\u00e7\u00e3o posterior bloqueada em c\u00f3digo (regra 11)."}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_formatos", "label": "Tabela formatos", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_camaras", "label": "Tabela camaras", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_operadores", "label": "Tabela operadores", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "pinHash nunca sai do backend; PIN individual por operador."}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_sessoesoperador", "label": "Tabela sessoesOperador", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sess\u00e3o presa a UMA c\u00e2mara, 12h; \u00edndice by_operador_id permite invalidar todas as sess\u00f5es ao gerar novo PIN."}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_usuarios", "label": "Tabela usuarios (Admin/Clerk)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_veiculos", "label": "Tabela veiculos", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_contagens", "label": "Tabela contagens", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_contagemitens", "label": "Tabela contagemItens", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Registra por produtoId + formatoId (n\u00e3o por produto agregado), porque agregar contagem por produto misturaria unidades de formatos diferentes no c\u00e1lculo de diverg\u00eancia."}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_saldodoformato", "label": "saldoDoFormato (fonte de verdade de saldo)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Soma o ledger por produtoId + camaraId + formatoId. Usado para saldo consult\u00e1vel, valida\u00e7\u00e3o de sa\u00edda e compara\u00e7\u00e3o de contagem. Nunca agrega quantidade entre formatos diferentes."}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_pesototaldoproduto", "label": "pesoTotalDoProduto (agrega\u00e7\u00e3o por peso)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Para o painel, agrega os formatos de um produto por PESO (kg) \u2014 a \u00fanica unidade compar\u00e1vel entre formatos diferentes. Nunca soma quantidade."}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_gerarpinoperador", "label": "Mutation gerarPinOperador", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Na mesma transa\u00e7\u00e3o gera o PIN, salva o hash e deleta todas as sessoesOperador daquele operadorId (via by_operador_id). PIN em texto puro retornado uma \u00fanica vez."}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_garantirusuario", "label": "Mutation interna garantirUsuario", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cria o registro em usuarios a partir do clerkId no primeiro login; \u00fanica escrita em usuarios."}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_ledger_append_only", "label": "Princ\u00edpio: ledger append-only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "movimentacoes nunca \u00e9 editada nem deletada, por nenhum perfil. Corre\u00e7\u00e3o se faz com nova movimenta\u00e7\u00e3o de ajuste, gerada s\u00f3 por contagem aprovada."}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_sem_campo_saldo", "label": "Princ\u00edpio: n\u00e3o existe campo saldo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Todo saldo \u00e9 somado do ledger em leitura. Snapshot peri\u00f3dico \u00e9 decis\u00e3o de v2, s\u00f3 acima de ~100k movimenta\u00e7\u00f5es por produto \u2014 nunca um campo saldo."}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_idempotencia", "label": "Idempot\u00eancia por chaveIdempotencia", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "UUID gerado no cliente; antes de inserir busca por by_chave_idempotencia e devolve o existente sem inserir. Protege contra duplo-toque e retry."}, {"id": "docs_02_schema_convex_autorizacao_sem_rls", "label": "Autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o em c\u00f3digo (Convex sem RLS)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Toda autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o vive dentro de cada query e mutation; n\u00e3o existe function operacional sem checagem de identidade e escopo. Mutation valida produto.camaraId === sessao.camaraId."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_02_schema_convex_ledger_append_only", "target": "docs_02_schema_convex_movimentacoes", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_02_schema_convex_sem_campo_saldo", "target": "docs_02_schema_convex_saldodoformato", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_02_schema_convex_saldodoformato", "target": "docs_02_schema_convex_movimentacoes", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_02_schema_convex_pesototaldoproduto", "target": "docs_02_schema_convex_movimentacoes", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/02-schema-convex.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 